 if(step==67){var view=GameHub.GetComponentInChildren<RiftAchievementView>();Check(view.VisibleCount==4&&view.Filter=="Combate","Logros combat category still filters real data");Press(UnityEngine.InputSystem.Key.Escape);Advance();return;}
 if(step==68){Release();Check(!ClientFrontend.Pause,"Logros closes normally after skills/talents");Finish(true);}
 }
 static void CheckBounds(){foreach(string name in new[]{"Jugar","Personaje","Ajustes","Salir"}){var rect=(RectTransform)Button(name).transform;var corners=new Vector3[4];rect.GetWorldCorners(corners);Check(corners.All(p=>p.x>=0&&p.y>=0&&p.x<=Screen.width&&p.y<=Screen.height),"Primary button stays inside screen: "+name);}var renderers=hub.Stage.PreviewSubject.GetComponentsInChildren<Renderer>().Where(r=>r.enabled&&r.gameObject.activeInHierarchy).ToArray();var bounds=renderers[0].bounds;foreach(var r in renderers)bounds.Encapsulate(r.bounds);var low=hub.Stage.PreviewCamera.WorldToViewportPoint(bounds.min);var high=hub.Stage.PreviewCamera.WorldToViewportPoint(bounds.max);Check(low.y>0&&high.y<1,"Full real character including feet fits preview camera");}
 static void Finish(bool success){EditorApplication.update-=Tick;var player=ClientFrontend.ClientPlayerInstance;if(originalSpecies&&player)player.GetComponent<AbilityController>().Species=originalSpecies;if(fixtureAbility)UnityEngine.Object.Destroy(fixtureAbility);if(fixtureClass)UnityEngine.Object.Destroy(fixtureClass);if(fixtureSpecies)UnityEngine.Object.Destroy(fixtureSpecies);foreach(var pair in devices)if(pair.Key)pair.Key.devices=pair.Value;devices.Clear();if(keyboard!=null)InputSystem.RemoveDevice(keyboard);if(mouse!=null)InputSystem.RemoveDevice(mouse);InputSystem.settings.backgroundBehavior=(InputSettings.BackgroundBehavior)oldBackground;InputSystem.settings.editorInputBehaviorInPlayMode=(InputSettings.EditorInputBehaviorInPlayMode)oldEditorInput;File.WriteAllLines(Path.Combine(Output,"validation.txt"),result);SessionState.SetInt(Key+"Result",success?0:1);if(NetworkServer.active)NetworkManager.singleton.StopHost();EditorApplication.isPlaying=false;}
 static EditorWindow View()=>EditorWindow.GetWindow(typeof(EditorWindow).Assembly.GetType("UnityEditor.GameView"));
 static void SetSize(int width,int height,bool save){var asm=typeof(EditorWindow).Assembly;var view=View();var selected=view.GetType().GetProperty("selectedSizeIndex",BindingFlags.Instance|BindingFlags.Public|BindingFlags.NonPublic);if(save)SessionState.SetInt(Key+"ViewIndex",(int)selected.GetValue(view));var type=asm.GetType("UnityEditor.GameViewSizes");var instance=typeof(ScriptableSingleton<>).MakeGenericType(type).GetProperty("instance",BindingFlags.Public|BindingFlags.Static).GetValue(null);var groupType=asm.GetType("UnityEditor.GameViewSizeGroupType");var group=type.GetMethod("GetGroup").Invoke(instance,new[]{Enum.Parse(groupType,"Standalone")});var sizeType=asm.GetType("UnityEditor.GameViewSizeType");var size=Activator.CreateInstance(asm.GetType("UnityEditor.GameViewSize"),BindingFlags.Instance|BindingFlags.Public|BindingFlags.NonPublic,null,new object[]{Enum.Parse(sizeType,"FixedResolution"),width,height,"ROM Menu Review "+width+"x"+height},null);group.GetType().GetMethod("AddCustomSize").Invoke(group,new[]{size});int index=(int)group.GetType().GetMethod("GetTotalCount").Invoke(group,null)-1;selected.SetValue(view,index);view.Repaint();}
 static void RestoreSize(){var view=View();view.GetType().GetProperty("selectedSizeIndex",BindingFlags.Instance|BindingFlags.Public|BindingFlags.NonPublic).SetValue(view,SessionState.GetInt(Key+"ViewIndex",0));view.Repaint();}
